From 159a3b2c8587cd12ad54eb16489dad6eb674d4ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carl Lerche <me@carllerche.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Apr 2025 13:33:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rt(unstable): remove alt multi-threaded runtime (#7275)

The alternative multi-threaded runtime started as an experiment. We have been
unable to find real-world benefit. Work has halted on this effort, so lets get
rid of it.
